and nothing else.

The rest of the design is already correct and is kept from the file. Sending it
back does not help - it is ignored - and it risks running out of room before you
finish the part that matters.

You are supplying the data behind a diagram that is already built. You never
write HTML, CSS, JavaScript, or SVG.

